          <h2 class="heading-lg editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="58" data-text="48">Every treat starts with <span style="color:var(--success);">a wag</span> and a <span style="color:var(--success);">purpose</span>.</h2>
          <div class="story-quote editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="59" data-text="49">
            "We believe that healthy pets make happy families."
          </div>
          <p class="body-large editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="60" data-text="50">Founded by a team of pet lovers and nutritionists, PAWS & CO. was born from a simple belief: our pets deserve the same quality of food we'd want for ourselves. Every recipe is crafted with real, recognizable ingredients — no fillers, no by-products, no compromise.</p>
          <a href="#product" class="primary-action editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="61" data-text="51" style="align-self:flex-start;"><i class="fas fa-paw"></i> Shop Our Treats</a>
