          <div class="stars"><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star"></i><i class="fas fa-star-half-alt"></i></div>
          <p>"Finally, treats I feel good about giving. My vet noticed the difference!"</p>
          <div class="review-meta"><span><strong>Amanda R.</strong> <span style="color:var(--success);">✓ Verified</span></span><span>3 weeks ago</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <section id="faq" class="editable-section" data-section="88">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="89" data-text="72" style="display:block; text-align:center;">Got questions?</span>
      <h2 class="heading-lg editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="90" data-text="73" style="text-align:center; margin-bottom:var(--space-md);">We've got <span style="color:var(--success);">answers</span>.</h2>
      <div style="max-width:700px; margin:0 auto;">
        <div class="faq-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="91"><div class="faq-question editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-target="faq1" data-section="92" data-text="74">Are your treats safe for puppies? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" id="faq1" data-section="93" data-text="75">Yes! All our treats are formulated to be safe for puppies 8 weeks and older. Always supervise your pet when feeding.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="94"><div class="faq-question editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-target="faq2" data-section="95" data-text="76">What are the ingredients? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" id="faq2" data-section="96" data-text="77">Real chicken, sweet potatoes, peas, chickpeas, and a blend of natural vitamins and minerals. No artificial preservatives.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="97"><div class="faq-question editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-target="faq3" data-section="98" data-text="78">How long does shipping take? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" id="faq3" data-section="99" data-text="79">Standard shipping takes 3-5 business days. Express shipping is available at checkout.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="100"><div class="faq-question editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-target="faq4" data-section="101" data-text="80">What if my pet doesn't like them? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" id="faq4" data-section="102" data-text="81">We offer a 100% satisfaction guarantee. If your pet doesn't love them, we'll refund your purchase — no questions asked.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="103"><div class="faq-question editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-target="faq5" data-section="104" data-text="82">Are these safe for cats too? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" id="faq5" data-section="105" data-text="83">Our treats are formulated for both dogs and cats! They're soft enough for cats to enjoy too.</div></div>
        <div class="faq-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="106"><div class="faq-question editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-target="faq6" data-section="107" data-text="84">What's your return policy? <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></div><div class="faq-answer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" id="faq6" data-section="108" data-text="85">30-day hassle-free returns on all unopened products. Contact us and we'll make it right.</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FINAL CTA -->
  <section class="section-padding editable-section" data-section="109" style="padding-top:0;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="final-cta editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="110">
        <h2 class="heading-lg editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="111" data-text="86">Your pet deserves the <span style="color:var(--success);">very best</span>.</h2>
        <p style="font-size:1.2rem; opacity:0.8; margin:var(--space-xs) 0;" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="112" data-text="87">Join thousands of happy pets and their families.</p>
        <a href="#product" class="primary-action editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="113" data-text="88"><i class="fas fa-paw"></i> Shop Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CONTACT -->
  <section id="contact" class="editable-section" data-section="114">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="contact-grid">
        <div class="contact-info">
          <span class="eyebrow editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="115" data-text="89">Get in touch</span>
          <h2 class="heading-lg editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="116" data-text="90">We'd love to <span style="color:var(--success);">hear</span> from you.</h2>
          <p class="body-large editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="117" data-text="91" style="max-width:400px;">Have questions about our products or your pet's specific needs? Reach out — we're here to help.</p>
          <div class="contact-detail editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="118" data-text="92">
            <i class="fas fa-envelope"></i>
            <span>hello@pawsandco.com</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-detail editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="119" data-text="93">
            <i class="fas fa-phone"></i>
            <span>+1 (800) 555‑0199</span>
          </div>
          <div class="contact-detail editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="120" data-text="94">
            <i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i>
            <span>Portland, OR</span>
          </div>
          <div style="display:flex; gap:var(--space-sm); margin-top:var(--space-xs); font-size:1.4rem; color:var(--secondary);">
            <a href="#" class="editable-icon" data-icon="101"><i class="fab fa-instagram"></i></a>
            <a href="#" class="editable-icon" data-icon="102"><i class="fab fa-tiktok"></i></a>
            <a href="#" class="editable-icon" data-icon="103"><i class="fab fa-x-twitter"></i></a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="contact-form-wrapper editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="121">
          <form id="contactForm" novalidate>
            <div class="form-row">
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="contactName" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="122" data-text="95">Your Name</label>
                <input type="text" id="contactName" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="123" data-text="96" placeholder="Your name" required />
              </div>
              <div class="form-group">
                <label for="contactEmail" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="124" data-text="97">Email Address</label>
                <input type="email" id="contactEmail" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="125" data-text="98" placeholder="you@example.com" required />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contactSubject" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="126" data-text="99">Subject</label>
              <input type="text" id="contactSubject" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="127" data-text="100" placeholder="What's this about?" required />
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
              <label for="contactMessage" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="128" data-text="101">Message</label>
              <textarea id="contactMessage" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="129" data-text="102" placeholder="Tell us about your pet and how we can help..." required></textarea>
            </div>
            <button type="submit" class="submit-action editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="130" data-text="103">
              <i class="fas fa-paper-plane"></i> Send Message
            </button>
            <div id="formSuccess" style="display:none; padding:var(--space-sm); background:var(--success); color:white; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); text-align:center; font-weight:600; margin-top:var(--space-sm);">
              <i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="margin-right:8px;"></i> Thanks! We'll get back to you within 24 hours. 🐾
            </div>
            <div id="formError" style="display:none; padding:var(--space-sm); background:#c0392b; color:white; border-radius:var(--radius-sm); text-align:center; font-weight:600; margin-top:var(--space-sm);">
              <i class="fas fa-exclamation-circle" style="margin-right:8px;"></i> Please fill in all fields correctly.
            </div>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FOOTER -->
  <footer class="site-footer editable-section" data-section="131">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="footer-grid">
        <div class="footer-col">
          <div class="logo-footer editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="132" data-text="104">PAWS<span>&</span>CO. <i class="fas fa-paw" style="color:var(--success);"></i></div>
          <p style="font-size:0.85rem; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-top:var(--space-xs);" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="133" data-text="105">Premium pet care made with love.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h4 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="134" data-text="106">Navigate</h4><a href="#hero" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="135" data-text="107">Home</a><a href="#product" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="136" data-text="108">Shop</a><a href="#story" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="137" data-text="109">Our Story</a><a href="#features" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="138" data-text="110">Why Paws</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h4 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="139" data-text="111">Support</h4><a href="#faq" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="140" data-text="112">FAQ</a><a href="#contact" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="141" data-text="113">Contact</a><a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="142" data-text="114">Shipping</a><a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="143" data-text="115">Returns</a></div>
        <div class="footer-col"><h4 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="144" data-text="116">Connect</h4><a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="145" data-text="117"><i class="fab fa-instagram" style="margin-right:6px;"></i> Instagram</a><a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="146" data-text="118"><i class="fab fa-tiktok" style="margin-right:6px;"></i> TikTok</a><a href="#" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="147" data-text="119"><i class="fab fa-x-twitter" style="margin-right:6px;"></i> X</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="footer-bottom editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="148" data-text="120">&copy; 2025 PAWS & CO. All rights reserved. Made with ❤️ for pets everywhere.</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- STICKY BAR -->
  <div id="stickyBar" class="sticky-purchase">
    <div class="sticky-info">
      <strong class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="149" data-text="121">Organic Chicken Bites</strong>
      <span style="color:var(--secondary);" id="stickyPrice" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="150" data-text="122">$32</span>
      <span id="stickySize" class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="151" data-text="123">Small</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sticky-actions">
      <button id="stickyAddToCart" class="sticky-btn-cart editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="152" data-text="124"><i class="fas fa-shopping-bag"></i> Add</button>
      <button id="stickyBuyNow" class="sticky-btn-buy editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="153" data-text="125"><i class="fas fa-bolt"></i> Buy</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script>
    (function() {
      "use strict";

      // ============================================
      // SCROLL ANIMATIONS — Reveal on Scroll
      // ============================================
      function initScrollAnimations() {
        const revealElements = document.querySelectorAll('.reveal, .reveal-left, .reveal-right, .reveal-scale, .stagger-children');
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.classList.add('visible');
            }
          });
        }, {
          threshold: 0.15,
          rootMargin: '0px 0px -50px 0px'
        });
        revealElements.forEach(el => observer.observe(el));
      }

      // ============================================
      // PARALLAX EFFECTS
      // ============================================
      function initParallax() {
        const heroImage = document.querySelector('.hero-image img');
        if (heroImage) {
          window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            const scrollY = window.scrollY;
            const speed = 0.08;
            const translateY = scrollY * speed;
            heroImage.style.transform = `translateY(${translateY}px) scale(1.02)`;
          }, { passive: true });
        }

        // Parallax for story image
        const storyImage = document.querySelector('.story-image img');
        if (storyImage) {
          window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            const rect = storyImage.getBoundingClientRect();
            const speed = 0.06;
            const offset = (window.innerHeight - rect.top) * speed;
            if (offset > -100 && offset < 200) {
              storyImage.style.transform = `translateY(${offset * 0.3}px)`;
            }
          }, { passive: true });
        }

        // Parallax background shapes
        const hero = document.getElementById('hero');
        if (hero) {
          window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
            const scrollY = window.scrollY;
            const shapes = hero.querySelectorAll('::before, ::after');
            // Using CSS custom properties for background position
            const offset = scrollY * 0.05;
            hero.style.setProperty('--parallax-offset', `${offset}px`);
          }, { passive: true });
        }
      }

      // ============================================
      // DOM refs (existing code)
      // ============================================
      const hamburger = document.getElementById('hamburgerBtn');
      const mobileNavOverlay = document.getElementById('mobileNavOverlay');
      const mobileNavDrawer = document.getElementById('mobileNavDrawer');
      const closeMobileNav = document.getElementById('closeMobileNav');
      const cartTrigger = document.getElementById('cartTrigger');
      const cartOverlay = document.getElementById('cartOverlay');
      const cartDrawer = document.getElementById('cartDrawer');
      const closeCart = document.getElementById('closeCart');
      const cartItems = document.getElementById('cartItems');
      const cartFooter = document.getElementById('cartFooter');
      const cartSubtotal = document.getElementById('cartSubtotal');
      const cartTotal = document.getElementById('cartTotal');
      const cartCount = document.getElementById('cartCount');
      const mobileCartCount = document.getElementById('mobileCartCount');
      const addToCartBtn = document.getElementById('addToCartBtn');
      const buyNowBtn = document.getElementById('buyNowBtn');
      const stickyAddToCart = document.getElementById('stickyAddToCart');
      const stickyBuyNow = document.getElementById('stickyBuyNow');
      const qtyDisplay = document.getElementById('qtyDisplay');
      const qtyDec = document.getElementById('qtyDec');
      const qtyInc = document.getElementById('qtyInc');
      const sizeSelector = document.getElementById('sizeSelector');
      const flavorSelector = document.getElementById('flavorSelector');
      const stickySize = document.getElementById('stickySize');
      const stickyPrice = document.getElementById('stickyPrice');
      const displayPrice = document.getElementById('displayPrice');
      const mainImage = document.getElementById('mainProductImage');
      const toast = document.getElementById('toast');
      const viewer = document.getElementById('imageViewer');
      const viewerImg = document.getElementById('viewerImage');
      const closeImageViewer = document.getElementById('closeImageViewer');
      const galleryItems = document.querySelectorAll('.community-card img');
      const faqQuestions = document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question');
      const reviewGrid = document.getElementById('reviewGrid');
      const writeReviewBtn = document.getElementById('writeReviewBtn');
      const videoModal = document.getElementById('videoModal');
      const closeVideo = document.getElementById('closeVideo');
      const watchFilmBtn = document.getElementById('watchFilmBtn');
      const videoIframe = document.getElementById('videoIframe');
      const thumbnailStrip = document.getElementById('thumbnailStrip');
      const siteHeader = document.getElementById('siteHeader');
      const contactForm = document.getElementById('contactForm');
      const formSuccess = document.getElementById('formSuccess');
      const formError = document.getElementById('formError');

      // ============================================
      // STATE
      // ============================================
      let cart = [];
      let quantity = 1;
      let selectedSize = 'Small';
      let selectedFlavor = 'Chicken';
      let price = 32;

      // ============================================
      // CART HELPERS
      // ============================================
      function updateCartUI() {
        const totalItems = cart.reduce((sum, item) => sum + item.qty, 0);
        cartCount.textContent = totalItems;
        mobileCartCount.textContent = totalItems;
        if (cart.length === 0) {
          cartItems.innerHTML = `<div class="cart-empty-state"><i class="fas fa-paw"></i><p>Your cart is empty.</p><p style="font-size:0.9rem;">Start shopping for your furry friend!</p><a href="#product" style="text-decoration:underline; font-weight:600; color:var(--success);">Shop now</a></div>`;
          cartFooter.style.display = 'none';
        } else {
          let html = '';
          let subtotal = 0;
          cart.forEach((item, idx) => {
            const itemTotal = item.qty * item.price;
            subtotal += itemTotal;
            html += `
              <div class="cart-item">
                <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583511655857-d19b40a7a54e?w=100&h=100&fit=crop&crop=center&auto=format" alt="treats">
                <div class="cart-item-details">
                  <h4>Organic Chicken Bites</h4>
                  <p>${item.size} · ${item.flavor}</p>
                  <p>$${itemTotal.toFixed(2)}</p>
                </div>
                <button class="cart-item-remove" data-index="${idx}"><i class="fas fa-times"></i></button>
              </div>
            `;
          });
          cartItems.innerHTML = html;
          cartFooter.style.display = 'block';
          cartSubtotal.textContent = `$${subtotal.toFixed(2)}`;
          cartTotal.textContent = `$${subtotal.toFixed(2)}`;
          document.querySelectorAll('.cart-item-remove').forEach(btn => {
            btn.addEventListener('click', function() {
              const idx = parseInt(this.dataset.index);
              cart.splice(idx, 1);
              updateCartUI();
              showToast('Removed from cart.');
            });
          });
        }
      }

      function showToast(msg) {
        toast.innerHTML = `<i class="fas fa-heart"></i> ${msg} 🐾`;
        toast.classList.add('show');
        clearTimeout(toast._timer);
        toast._timer = setTimeout(() => toast.classList.remove('show'), 2500);
      }

      function getCurrentVariant() {
        return { size: selectedSize, flavor: selectedFlavor, qty: quantity, price: price };
      }

      function addToCartAction() {
        const variant = getCurrentVariant();
        const existing = cart.find(item => item.size === variant.size && item.flavor === variant.flavor);
        if (existing) {
          existing.qty += variant.qty;
        } else {
          cart.push({ ...variant });
        }
        updateCartUI();
        showToast('Added to your cart!');
        cartTrigger.style.transform = 'scale(1.2)';
        setTimeout(() => cartTrigger.style.transform = 'scale(1)', 200);
        cartOverlay.classList.add('open');
        cartDrawer.classList.add('open');
      }

      function buyNowAction() { addToCartAction(); }

      function updatePrice() {
        displayPrice.textContent = `$${price}`;
        stickyPrice.textContent = `$${price}`;
      }

      // ============================================
      // EVENT LISTENERS
      // ============================================

      // Size selector
      sizeSelector.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const btn = e.target.closest('button');
        if (!btn) return;
        sizeSelector.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        selectedSize = btn.dataset.size;
        stickySize.textContent = selectedSize;
      });

      // Flavor selector
      flavorSelector.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const btn = e.target.closest('button');
        if (!btn) return;
        flavorSelector.querySelectorAll('button').forEach(b => b.classList.remove('active'));
        btn.classList.add('active');
        selectedFlavor = btn.dataset.flavor;
      });

      // Quantity
      qtyDec.addEventListener('click', () => {
        if (quantity > 1) { quantity--; qtyDisplay.textContent = quantity; }
      });
      qtyInc.addEventListener('click', () => {
        quantity++; qtyDisplay.textContent = quantity;
      });

      // Action buttons
      addToCartBtn.addEventListener('click', addToCartAction);
      buyNowBtn.addEventListener('click', buyNowAction);
      stickyAddToCart.addEventListener('click', addToCartAction);
      stickyBuyNow.addEventListener('click', buyNowAction);

      // Thumbnails
      thumbnailStrip.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        const img = e.target.closest('img');
        if (!img) return;
        thumbnailStrip.querySelectorAll('img').forEach(i => i.classList.remove('active'));
        img.classList.add('active');
        if (img.dataset.main && mainImage) {
          mainImage.style.opacity = '0.6';
          setTimeout(() => {
            mainImage.src = img.dataset.main;
            mainImage.style.opacity = '1';
          }, 150);
        }
      });

      // Mobile nav
      function openMobileNav() {
        mobileNavOverlay.classList.add('open');
        mobileNavDrawer.classList.add('open');
        document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
      }
      function closeMobileNavFn() {
        mobileNavOverlay.classList.remove('open');
        mobileNavDrawer.classList.remove('open');
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
      }
      hamburger.addEventListener('click', openMobileNav);
      closeMobileNav.addEventListener('click', closeMobileNavFn);
      mobileNavOverlay.addEventListener('click', closeMobileNavFn);
      document.querySelectorAll('.mobile-nav-links a').forEach(link => {
        link.addEventListener('click', closeMobileNavFn);
      });

      // Cart drawer
      cartTrigger.addEventListener('click', () => {
        cartOverlay.classList.add('open');
        cartDrawer.classList.add('open');
      });
      closeCart.addEventListener('click', () => {
        cartOverlay.classList.remove('open');
        cartDrawer.classList.remove('open');
      });
      cartOverlay.addEventListener('click', () => {
        cartOverlay.classList.remove('open');
        cartDrawer.classList.remove('open');
      });

      // Sticky bar + header shadow
      let stickyVisible = false;
      const productTop = document.getElementById('product').offsetTop - 100;
      window.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
        const scrollY = window.scrollY;
        if (scrollY > productTop && !stickyVisible) {
          document.getElementById('stickyBar').classList.add('visible');
          stickyVisible = true;
        } else if (scrollY <= productTop && stickyVisible) {
          document.getElementById('stickyBar').classList.remove('visible');
          stickyVisible = false;
        }
        if (scrollY > 50) {
          siteHeader.classList.add('scrolled');
        } else {
          siteHeader.classList.remove('scrolled');
        }
      }, { passive: true });

      // Video modal
      function openVideo() {
        videoModal.classList.add('open');
        document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        videoIframe.src = 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ?autoplay=1&mute=1&rel=0';
      }
      function closeVideoFn() {
        videoModal.classList.remove('open');
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
        videoIframe.src = 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/dQw4w9WgXcQ?rel=0&mute=1';
      }
      watchFilmBtn.addEventListener('click', openVideo);
      closeVideo.addEventListener('click', closeVideoFn);
      videoModal.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (e.target === videoModal) closeVideoFn();
      });

      // Image viewer
      galleryItems.forEach(img => {
        img.addEventListener('click', () => {
          viewerImg.src = img.src;
          viewer.classList.add('open');
          document.body.style.overflow = 'hidden';
        });
      });
      closeImageViewer.addEventListener('click', () => {
        viewer.classList.remove('open');
        document.body.style.overflow = '';
      });
      viewer.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
        if (e.target === viewer) {
          viewer.classList.remove('open');
          document.body.style.overflow = '';
        }
      });

      // FAQ
      faqQuestions.forEach(q => {
        q.addEventListener('click', function() {
          const targetId = this.dataset.target;
          const answer = document.getElementById(targetId);
          const isOpen = answer.classList.contains('open');
          document.querySelectorAll('.faq-answer').forEach(a => a.classList.remove('open'));
          document.querySelectorAll('.faq-question').forEach(q2 => q2.classList.remove('open'));
          if (!isOpen) {
            answer.classList.add('open');
            this.classList.add('open');
          }
        });
      });

      // Write review
      writeReviewBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
        const name = prompt('Your name:');
        if (!name) return;
        const rating = prompt('Rating (1-5):');
        const reviewText = prompt('Your review:');
        if (!reviewText) return;
        const stars = '★'.repeat(Math.min(5, Math.max(1, parseInt(rating) || 5)));
        const emojis = ['🐶', '🐱', '🐾', '🦴', '❤️'];
        const emoji = emojis[Math.floor(Math.random() * emojis.length)];
        const card = document.createElement('div');
        card.className = 'review-card';
        card.innerHTML = `
          <span class="review-emoji">${emoji}</span>
          <div class="stars">${stars}</div>
          <p>"${reviewText}"</p>
          <div class="review-meta"><span><strong>${name}</strong> <span style="color:var(--success);">✓ Verified</span></span><span>Just now</span></div>
        `;
        reviewGrid.prepend(card);
        card.style.opacity = '0';
        requestAnimationFrame(() => { card.style.transition = 'opacity 0.5s'; card.style.opacity = '1'; });
      });

      // Contact form
      contactForm.addEventListener('submit', function(e) {
        e.preventDefault();
        const name = document.getElementById('contactName').value.trim();
        const email = document.getElementById('contactEmail').value.trim();
        const subject = document.getElementById('contactSubject').value.trim();
        const message = document.getElementById('contactMessage').value.trim();
        if (!name || !email || !subject || !message || !email.includes('@')) {
          formError.style.display = 'block';
          formSuccess.style.display = 'none';
          setTimeout(() => formError.style.display = 'none', 4000);
          return;
        }
        formError.style.display = 'none';
        formSuccess.style.display = 'block';
        contactForm.reset();
        setTimeout(() => formSuccess.style.display = 'none', 5000);
      });

      // ============================================
      // INIT
      // ============================================
      updateCartUI();
      updatePrice();
      initScrollAnimations();
      initParallax();

    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>